1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,910
You spotted Pearl Harbor on radar,

2
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:04,720
46 minutes early. You called it in.

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:07,960
So why did over 2,400 Americans still die?

4
00:00:08,325 --> 00:00:11,605
December 7, 1941. Opana Point,

5
00:00:11,605 --> 00:00:13,235
on the northern tip of Oahu.

6
00:00:13,565 --> 00:00:15,525
Two privates, Joseph Lockard and George

7
00:00:15,525 --> 00:00:17,695
Elliott, are running a mobile radar.

8
00:00:18,161 --> 00:00:20,501
It's only allowed to run four hours a day,

9
00:00:20,501 --> 00:00:22,601
and it's due to shut down at 7.

10
00:00:22,601 --> 00:00:24,561
But the truck taking them to breakfast is

11
00:00:24,561 --> 00:00:26,331
late. So they keep practicing.

12
00:00:26,797 --> 00:00:29,147
At 7:02, a huge echo appears.

13
00:00:29,657 --> 00:00:31,797
Planes, 130 miles out,

14
00:00:31,797 --> 00:00:32,837
coming in from the north.

15
00:00:32,837 --> 00:00:34,527
More than they have ever seen.

16
00:00:34,893 --> 00:00:37,073
Lockard phones the information center at

17
00:00:37,073 --> 00:00:39,953
Fort Shafter. The officer on duty is Lieutenant

18
00:00:39,953 --> 00:00:42,433
Kermit Tyler. He arrived a week ago,

19
00:00:42,433 --> 00:00:43,763
with almost no training.

20
00:00:44,099 --> 00:00:47,159
Tyler knows six B-17 bombers are flying

21
00:00:47,159 --> 00:00:48,929
in from the mainland that morning.

22
00:00:49,199 --> 00:00:50,969
So he tells them not to worry.

23
00:00:51,396 --> 00:00:53,346
Lockard and Elliott keep tracking it anyway.

24
00:00:53,836 --> 00:00:56,136
Closer. And closer. At 7:40,

25
00:00:56,136 --> 00:00:57,066
they lose contact.

26
00:00:57,648 --> 00:00:59,608
Eight minutes later, the first Japanese

27
00:00:59,608 --> 00:01:02,598
planes strike Oahu. By the end of the morning,

28
00:01:02,748 --> 00:01:04,898
over 2,400 Americans are dead.

29
00:01:05,264 --> 00:01:06,714
Tyler was later cleared.

30
00:01:07,544 --> 00:01:09,084
Investigators found he'd been left with

31
00:01:09,084 --> 00:01:10,834
no training, no supervision,

32
00:01:11,064 --> 00:01:11,814
and no staff.

33
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:13,460
The warning came in time.

34
00:01:13,710 --> 00:01:15,340
The system wasn't built to hear it.

35
00:01:15,630 --> 00:01:16,900
Would you have sounded the alarm?

36
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:17,760
Tell me below.

